  "description": "AlterNET Form Designer is a .NET component library providing a quick and convenient way to create visual user interfaces. It lets you design UI by adding controls to a design surface, arranging them, and writing code for their events.\n\nThis package includes common WPF utility and helper classes required for integrating Form Designer with Code Editor.\n\nThis multi-target package can be used with .NET applications targeting .NET Framework starting from 4.5.2.\n\nMore information about Form Designer can be found here:\nhttps://www.alternetsoft.com/products/designer\n\nDocumentation and sample projects can be downloaded here:\nhttps://www.alternetsoft.com/download\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires purchasing a license for legal usage. Please refer to our licensing FAQ here:\nhttps://www.alternetsoft.com/faq#license",
